'''Light Beacon'''<ref name="game" /> is a light-type [[Spells|spell]] that creates a beam of light.

==Description==
The [[Casting Seal]] contains a [[Sigils#Light|Sigil of Light]] surrounded by [[Signs#Columns|Signs of Columns]]. The spell generates a stable, beam of light pointing up from the seal. 

==Usage==
[[Agott]] uses this spell to practice drawing seals without looking.{{Ref|m|9|24-25}}{{Ref|a|6}}

[[Olruggio]] once used this spell alongside [[Smoke Cloud]] to intimidate a herd of [[liongoat]]s chasing him and [[Qifrey]].{{Ref|m|91|4-5}}

