==Notes==
* Light Beacon is likely a simplified version of the [[Ancient Light Beacon]] spell.{{Ref|''Witch Hat Atelier'' Anime: [[Episode 11]] – [[Writing/Translated Texts#Primer Book 5]]}}
* Light Beacon is likely to serve as the base for [[Bird of Light Beacon]], another spell used by Agott with similarities in name and effect.
